WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.912
Raj: Archived WAL covers the whole required chain. Segments remain available through two fifteen.
归档WAL覆盖所需完整链，日志段可用到两点十五分。

2
00:00:06.912 --> 00:00:13.273
Lukas: Did replay stop at the requested point? Availability beyond it doesn't change scope.
回放停在请求目标点了吗？后面的日志可用不改变范围。

3
00:00:13.273 --> 00:00:20.017
Anika: Yes, logs show the recovery target reached. We inspected that before test access.
是，日志显示达到恢复目标，开放测试访问前检查过。

4
00:00:20.017 --> 00:00:27.962
Priya: Just to confirm, isolation remained intact, right? No application production endpoint was changed.
确认一下，隔离始终保持，对吧？没有改任何应用生产端点。

5
00:00:27.962 --> 00:00:33.986
Hannah: Let me tail the log myself. I see no missing segment warnings.
我自己盯日志，没有看到缺日志段警告。

6
00:00:33.986 --> 00:00:40.995
Raj: The backup manifest checks passed before replay. Timeline and target settings are attached.
回放前备份清单校验通过，时间线和目标设置已附。

7
00:00:40.995 --> 00:00:46.275
Lukas: Was recovery left paused or ended? I need the current server state.
恢复还暂停着还是已结束？需要明确服务器当前状态。

8
00:00:46.275 --> 00:00:52.635
Anika: It ended under the reviewed drill procedure. Test access opened after boundary checks.
按评审过的演练流程结束，边界检查后开放测试访问。

9
00:00:52.635 --> 00:00:58.252
Hannah: So a smoke test can run. That still doesn't prove every row.
那可以跑冒烟测试，但仍不能证明每一行正确。

10
00:00:58.252 --> 00:01:05.500
Priya: Okay, maybe summarize those checks next. Keep completed steps distinct from acceptance.
好，接下来总结检查吧，把已完成步骤和验收分开。

